      "evidence": "_find_git() resolves git from the inherited PATH and only rejects paths inside the current working directory. A repository-root git executable is accepted when the script runs from a repository subdirectory, and any attacker-controlled executable elsewhere on PATH is also accepted; subprocess.Popen then executes it with repository access.",
